# Build number

Whenever you make changes that will be shipped, **increment the build number** in `index.html`. Search for `Build: 2026-` (or the current year); the format is `Build: YYYY-MM-DD-NN`. Bump the last number (e.g. `2026-03-07-34` → `2026-03-07-35`).

# Deployment

When you make changes to this project, **always** provide the full deployment terminal commands the user can run to build and ship to GitHub. Use a **concrete commit message** that describes the change—never use placeholders like "Your commit message" or "Update".

Example:
```bash
cd /Users/peterk/Downloads/crossplay-helper
git add -A
git commit -m "Fix board stretch: use fixed 32px grid so cells stay square"
git push
```
